## OA1 — Two hops of citations with a large fan-out: placing the middle condition at the largest scale
traits: start=filtered scan hops=2 fan-out=explosive aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: w.year, w.cited_by_count | R3 middle: m.year | R6 aggregate / sort: o.title

### OA1 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(o.title, c)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[c DESC, o.title ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: o.title | count(*) AS c]
  :       GetProperty(o.title) [node:Work]
  :         RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
  :           Expand((m)-[_r1:CITES]->(o:Work))
  :             Filter((m.year >= 2015))
  :               GetProperty(m.year) [node:Work]
  :                 Expand((w)-[_r0:CITES]->(m:Work))
  :                   Filter((w.cited_by_count >= 1000))
  :                     GetProperty(w.cited_by_count) [node:Work]
  :                       Filter((w.year = 2020))
  :                         GetProperty(w.year) [node:Work]
  :                           EntityScan(w:Work)

### OA1 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[c DESC, o.title ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: o.title | count(*) AS c]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(o) out=(o, o.title)
        : GetProperty(o.title) [node:Work]
        :   Argument(o)
        StoreQuery[mysql] in=(m) out=(m)
          : Filter((m.year >= 2015))
          :   GetProperty(m.year) [node:Work]
          :     Argument(m)
          StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(w) out=(w, m, o)
            : RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
            :   Expand((m)-[_r1:CITES]->(o:Work))
            :     Expand((w)-[_r0:CITES]->(m:Work))
            :       Argument(w)
            StoreQuery[mysql] out=(w)
              : Filter((w.cited_by_count >= 1000))
              :   GetProperty(w.cited_by_count) [node:Work]
              :     Filter((w.year = 2020))
              :       GetProperty(w.year) [node:Work]
              :         EntityScan(w:Work)

### OA1 @document
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[c DESC, o.title ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: o.title | count(*) AS c]
      Fetch[mongo] in=(o) out=(o, o.title)
        : GetProperty(o.title) [node:Work]
        :   Argument(o)
        StoreQuery[mongo] in=(m) out=(m)
          : Filter((m.year >= 2015))
          :   GetProperty(m.year) [node:Work]
          :     Argument(m)
          StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(w) out=(w, m, o)
            : RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
            :   Expand((m)-[_r1:CITES]->(o:Work))
            :     Expand((w)-[_r0:CITES]->(m:Work))
            :       Argument(w)
            StoreQuery[mongo] out=(w)
              : Filter((w.cited_by_count >= 1000))
              :   GetProperty(w.cited_by_count) [node:Work]
              :     Filter((w.year = 2020))
              :       GetProperty(w.year) [node:Work]
              :         EntityScan(w:Work)

