              :       GetProperty(w.year) [node:Work]
              :         EntityScan(w:Work)

## OA2 — A whole-path condition on citation chains (many branches): the cost of extracting many paths
traits: start=filtered scan hops=1..3 fan-out=explosive variable-length aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: w.cited_by_count | R4 path: x.year | R6 aggregate / sort: o.venue

### OA2 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(o.venue, paths)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[paths DESC, o.venue ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: o.venue | count(*) AS paths]
  :       GetProperty(o.venue) [node:Work]
  :         Filter((o.year >= 2010))
  :           GetProperty(o.year) [node:Work]
  :             VarLengthExpand((w)-[_r0:CITES*1..3]->(o:Work)) seg[all(x IN nodes WHERE (x.year >= 2010))]
  :               Filter((w.year >= 2010))
  :                 GetProperty(w.year) [node:Work]
  :                   Filter((w.cited_by_count >= 20000))
  :                     GetProperty(w.cited_by_count) [node:Work]
  :                       EntityScan(w:Work)

### OA2 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[paths DESC, o.venue ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: o.venue | count(*) AS paths]
      StoreQuery[mysql] in=(o) out=(o, o.venue)
        : GetProperty(o.venue) [node:Work]
        :   Filter((o.year >= 2010))
        :     GetProperty(o.year) [node:Work]
        :       Argument(o)
        Coord Filter(all(x IN nodes(_seg__r0) WHERE (x.year >= 2010)))
          ListFetch[mysql] _seg__r0.nodes.year from _seg__r0 [elem:Work]
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(w) out=(w, _seg__r0, o)
              : VarLengthExpand((w)-[_r0:CITES*1..3]->(o:Work)) emit _seg__r0
              :   Argument(w)
              StoreQuery[mysql] out=(w)
                : Filter((w.year >= 2010))
                :   GetProperty(w.year) [node:Work]
                :     Filter((w.cited_by_count >= 20000))
                :       GetProperty(w.cited_by_count) [node:Work]
                :         EntityScan(w:Work)

