## OA3 — Two hops of co-authorship narrowed only by a middle paper, at the largest scale
traits: start=narrowed in the middle hops=2 fan-out=medium aggregate Top-20 | R3 middle: w.year, w.cited_by_count | R6 aggregate / sort: b.author_id

### OA3 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(b.author_id, c)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[c DESC, b.author_id ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: b.author_id | count(*) AS c]
  :       GetProperty(b.author_id) [node:Author]
  :         RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
  :           Expand((w)<-[_r1:AUTHORED]-(b:Author))
  :             Expand((w)<-[_r0:AUTHORED]-(a:Author))
  :               Filter((w.cited_by_count >= 500))
  :                 GetProperty(w.cited_by_count) [node:Work]
  :                   Filter((w.year = 2020))
  :                     GetProperty(w.year) [node:Work]
  :                       EntityScan(w:Work)

### OA3 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[c DESC, b.author_id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: b.author_id | count(*) AS c]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(b) out=(b, b.author_id)
        : GetProperty(b.author_id) [node:Author]
        :   Argument(b)
        StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(w) out=(w, b)
          : RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
          :   Expand((w)<-[_r1:AUTHORED]-(b:Author))
          :     Expand((w)<-[_r0:AUTHORED]-(a:Author))
          :       Argument(w)
          StoreQuery[mysql] out=(w)
            : Filter((w.cited_by_count >= 500))
            :   GetProperty(w.cited_by_count) [node:Work]
            :     Filter((w.year = 2020))
            :       GetProperty(w.year) [node:Work]
            :         EntityScan(w:Work)

